title: Bump litep2p to 0.16.0
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Bump litep2p to 0.16.0 (Kademlia client-server mode, local provider record fixes).
    The litep2p backend handles the new `KademliaEvent::PeersDiscovered` by reporting
    the peers through `Event::PeerRoutingTableUpdate` as before.
crates:
- name: sc-network
  bump: patch
